  "name": "es-entity",
  "description": "A high-performance Rust framework for implementing the Event Sourcing pattern with PostgreSQL backends, prioritizing type safety and developer ergonomics. It utilizes procedural macros to automate repository boilerplate and employs sqlx for compile-time verification of SQL queries, ensuring schema-level correctness at build time. The framework provides robust primitives for entity hydration, idempotent command execution, and recursive management of nested aggregates.",
